@api = http://localhost:5080

### Health (DB + Ollama models)
GET {{api}}/api/health

### Upload receipts
POST {{api}}/api/receipts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample-receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../samples/sample-receipt.jpg
--boundary--

### List receipts needing review
GET {{api}}/api/receipts?status=NeedsReview

### Stats
GET {{api}}/api/receipts/stats

### Vendors learned so far
GET {{api}}/api/vendors
